flowchart LR
    %% External entities
    Reader[Reader]
    DeliveryPartner[Delivery Partner]
    Admin[Admin]
    ApiClient[API Client]
    MapServices[External Map Services\nOSM Tiles / Nominatim / OSRM]

    %% Processes
    P1([P1 Authentication & Role Routing])
    P2([P2 Catalog & Offer Management])
    P3([P3 Exchange Request Processing])
    P4([P4 Delivery Lifecycle Management])
    P5([P5 Notification Processing])
    P6([P6 Admin Governance])
    P7([P7 Route & Location Visualization])

    %% Data stores
    D1[(D1 Users & Roles)]
    D2[(D2 Books Catalog)]
    D3[(D3 Offers)]
    D4[(D4 Offer Images Metadata)]
    D5[(D5 Exchange Requests)]
    D6[(D6 Delivery Offers)]
    D7[(D7 Notifications)]
    D8[(D8 Uploaded Offer Images\nFile Storage)]

    %% Auth flows
    Reader -->|register/login/profile data| P1
    DeliveryPartner -->|register/login| P1
    Admin -->|admin login| P1
    ApiClient -->|JWT login/register requests| P1
    P1 -->|user + role lookup| D1
    D1 -->|user credentials + authorities| P1
    P1 -->|session/JWT + role-based redirect| Reader
    P1 -->|session/JWT + role-based redirect| DeliveryPartner
    P1 -->|authenticated admin session| Admin

    %% Reader offer and exchange flows
    Reader -->|browse books, create/update/delete offers| P2
    P2 -->|book queries| D2
    D2 -->|catalog records| P2
    P2 -->|offer CRUD| D3
    D3 -->|offer records| P2
    P2 -->|save image URLs| D4
    P2 -->|store image files| D8
    P2 -->|offers + cost info response| Reader

    Reader -->|send/accept/reject exchange request| P3
    P3 -->|create/update exchange request| D5
    D5 -->|request records| P3
    P3 -->|reserve/unblock related offers| D3
    P3 -->|create delivery offer when accepted| D6
    P3 -->|exchange status response| Reader

    %% Delivery flows
    DeliveryPartner -->|accept pickup/complete actions| P4
    P4 -->|read exchange details| D5
    P4 -->|status + pickup updates| D6
    D6 -->|delivery task state| P4
    P4 -->|delivery status response| DeliveryPartner

    %% Route and location visualization
    Reader -->|open map / route preview| P7
    DeliveryPartner -->|open delivery map| P7
    P7 -->|route + geocoding requests| MapServices
    MapServices -->|tiles/routes/addresses| P7
    P7 -->|distance, delivery cost, map view| Reader
    P7 -->|distance, delivery cost, map view| DeliveryPartner

    %% Notifications
    P3 -->|publish exchange events| P5
    P4 -->|publish delivery events| P5
    P6 -->|publish admin/system events| P5
    P5 -->|persist notifications| D7
    D7 -->|notification list/summary| P5
    P5 -->|notifications + unread counts| Reader
    P5 -->|notifications + unread counts| DeliveryPartner
    P5 -->|notifications + unread counts| Admin

    %% Admin governance flows
    Admin -->|manage books/users/offers/exchanges| P6
    P6 -->|book CRUD| D2
    P6 -->|user block/unblock| D1
    P6 -->|offer moderation| D3
    P6 -->|approve exchange requests| D5
    P6 -->|delivery creation trigger| D6
    P6 -->|admin API responses| Admin
